{
  "status": "pass",
  "voice": "bm_george",
  "sample_rate": 24000,
  "sentences": 52,
  "duration_s": 241.7638,
  "target_wpm": 142,
  "schedule": [
    {
      "sentence_id": "S01",
      "text": "You walk into a room with a clear intention, and then the intention vanishes.",
      "emphasis": "THE DOORWAY RESET",
      "pace": 0.92,
      "start_s": 0.0,
      "speech_end_s": 5.812,
      "end_s": 5.962,
      "pause_after_s": 0.15,
      "audio_file": "sentence_audio/S01.wav"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "S02",
      "text": "A second ago, you knew exactly what you needed.",
      "emphasis": "I KNEW WHY",
      "pace": 0.92,
      "start_s": 5.962,
      "speech_end_s": 9.3106,
      "end_s": 9.4606,
      "pause_after_s": 0.15,
      "audio_file": "sentence_audio/S02.wav"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "S03",
      "text": "Now you are standing there, looking around as if the room changed the question.",
      "emphasis": "WHAT WAS I DOING?",
      "pace": 0.92,
      "start_s": 9.4606,
      "speech_end_s": 14.8673,
      "end_s": 15.0173,
      "pause_after_s": 0.15,
      "audio_file": "sentence_audio/S03.wav"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "S04",
      "text": "Then you retrace your steps, and the thought returns like a light switching back on.",
      "emphasis": "THE THOUGHT RETURNS",
      "pace": 0.92,
      "start_s": 15.0173,
      "speech_end_s": 20.626,
      "end_s": 20.776,
      "pause_after_s": 0.15,
      "audio_file": "sentence_audio/S04.wav"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "S05",
      "text": "Did the doorway erase your memory?",
      "emphasis": "DID IT ERASE YOU?",
      "pace": 0.92,
      "start_s": 20.776,
      "speech_end_s": 23.6993,
      "end_s": 23.9393,
      "pause_after_s": 0.24,
      "audio_file": "sentence_audio/S05.wav"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "S06",
      "text": "Not exactly.",
      "emphasis": "NOT EXACTLY",
      "pace": 0.92,
      "start_s": 23.9393,
      "speech_end_s": 25.5173,
      "end_s": 25.7572,
      "pause_after_s": 0.24,
      "audio_file": "sentence_audio/S06.wav"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "S07",
      "text": "The doorway may have changed the context in which your brain was holding the goal.",
      "emphasis": "THE CONTEXT CHANGED",
      "pace": 0.98,
      "start_s": 25.7572,
      "speech_end_s": 30.9832,
      "end_s": 31.1332,
      "pause_after_s": 0.15,
      "audio_file": "sentence_audio/S07.wav"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "S08",
      "text": "To understand that, start with what an intention actually is.",
      "emphasis": "WHAT IS AN INTENTION?",
      "pace": 0.98,
      "start_s": 31.1332,
      "speech_end_s": 35.2612,
      "end_s": 35.4112,
      "pause_after_s": 0.15,
      "audio_file": "sentence_audio/S08.wav"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "S09",
      "text": "It is not always a sentence sitting safely in a mental folder.",
      "emphasis": "NOT A FOLDER",
      "pace": 0.98,
      "start_s": 35.4112,
      "speech_end_s": 39.9645,
      "end_s": 40.1145,
      "pause_after_s": 0.15,
      "audio_file": "sentence_audio/S09.wav"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "S10",
      "text": "It is a temporary pattern your working memory keeps active while you act.",
      "emphasis": "WORKING MEMORY",
      "pace": 0.98,
      "start_s": 40.1145,
      "speech_end_s": 44.9252,
      "end_s": 45.0752,
      "pause_after_s": 0.15,
      "audio_file": "sentence_audio/S10.wav"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "S11",
      "text": "Remembering to get your keys, for example, has to survive distractions, movement and time.",
      "emphasis": "SURVIVE DISTRACTIONS",
      "pace": 0.98,
      "start_s": 45.0752,
      "speech_end_s": 51.4419,
      "end_s": 51.5919,
      "pause_after_s": 0.15,
      "audio_file": "sentence_audio/S11.wav"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "S12",
      "text": "The goal stays useful only while it remains available to guide the next action.",
      "emphasis": "GUIDE THE NEXT ACTION",
      "pace": 0.98,
      "start_s": 51.5919,
      "speech_end_s": 56.9985,
      "end_s": 57.1485,
      "pause_after_s": 0.15,
      "audio_file": "sentence_audio/S12.wav"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "S13",
      "text": "But working memory is limited and attention is constantly being redirected.",
      "emphasis": "ATTENTION IS LIMITED",
      "pace": 0.98,
      "start_s": 57.1485,
      "speech_end_s": 62.7585,
      "end_s": 62.9085,
      "pause_after_s": 0.15,
      "audio_file": "sentence_audio/S13.wav"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "S14",
      "text": "A notification arrives.",
      "emphasis": "A NOTIFICATION ARRIVES",
      "pace": 0.98,
      "start_s": 62.9085,
      "speech_end_s": 65.2772,
      "end_s": 65.4272,
      "pause_after_s": 0.15,
      "audio_file": "sentence_audio/S14.wav"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "S15",
      "text": "You notice a sound from the hallway.",
      "emphasis": "A SOUND INTERRUPTS",
      "pace": 0.98,
      "start_s": 65.4272,
      "speech_end_s": 68.2211,
      "end_s": 68.3711,
      "pause_after_s": 0.15,
      "audio_file": "sentence_audio/S15.wav"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "S16",
      "text": "You start thinking about what you will say later.",
      "emphasis": "ANOTHER THOUGHT",
      "pace": 0.98,
      "start_s": 68.3711,
      "speech_end_s": 71.9118,
      "end_s": 72.0618,
      "pause_after_s": 0.15,
      "audio_file": "sentence_audio/S16.wav"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "S17",
      "text": "The original intention can become weaker without disappearing completely.",
      "emphasis": "WEAKER, NOT GONE",
      "pace": 0.98,
      "start_s": 72.0618,
      "speech_end_s": 77.2877,
      "end_s": 77.4377,
      "pause_after_s": 0.15,
      "audio_file": "sentence_audio/S17.wav"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "S18",
      "text": "Then you cross into a new room.",
      "emphasis": "A NEW CONTEXT",
      "pace": 0.98,
      "start_s": 77.4377,
      "speech_end_s": 80.1664,
      "end_s": 80.3164,
      "pause_after_s": 0.15,
      "audio_file": "sentence_audio/S18.wav"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "S19",
      "text": "The visual scene changes, and your brain updates what is relevant around you.",
      "emphasis": "SCENE UPDATED",
      "pace": 0.98,
      "start_s": 80.3164,
      "speech_end_s": 85.5524,
      "end_s": 85.7024,
      "pause_after_s": 0.15,
      "audio_file": "sentence_audio/S19.wav"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "S20",
      "text": "That update is useful most of the time.",
      "emphasis": "UPDATING HELPS",
      "pace": 0.98,
      "start_s": 85.7024,
      "speech_end_s": 88.859,
      "end_s": 89.009,
      "pause_after_s": 0.15,
      "audio_file": "sentence_audio/S20.wav"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "S21",
      "text": "It lets you stop treating every room as the previous room.",
      "emphasis": "THE BRAIN UPDATES",
      "pace": 0.98,
      "start_s": 89.009,
      "speech_end_s": 92.9336,
      "end_s": 93.0836,
      "pause_after_s": 0.15,
      "audio_file": "sentence_audio/S21.wav"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "S22",
      "text": "But the old goal may not be the most relevant signal in the new scene.",
      "emphasis": "OLD GOAL OBSCURED",
      "pace": 0.98,
      "start_s": 93.0836,
      "speech_end_s": 97.8816,
      "end_s": 98.0316,
      "pause_after_s": 0.15,
      "audio_file": "sentence_audio/S22.wav"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "S23",
      "text": "The doorway did not delete the goal like a file.",
      "emphasis": "NOT A DELETE BUTTON",
      "pace": 0.92,
      "start_s": 98.0316,
      "speech_end_s": 101.6576,
      "end_s": 101.8976,
      "pause_after_s": 0.24,
      "audio_file": "sentence_audio/S23.wav"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "S24",
      "text": "It may have made the goal harder to retrieve from the new context.",
      "emphasis": "HARDER TO RETRIEVE",
      "pace": 0.98,
      "start_s": 101.8976,
      "speech_end_s": 105.9616,
      "end_s": 106.1116,
      "pause_after_s": 0.15,
      "audio_file": "sentence_audio/S24.wav"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "S25",
      "text": "This is where attention matters.",
      "emphasis": "ATTENTION SEARCHES",
      "pace": 0.98,
      "start_s": 106.1116,
      "speech_end_s": 108.6596,
      "end_s": 108.8096,
      "pause_after_s": 0.15,
      "audio_file": "sentence_audio/S25.wav"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "S26",
      "text": "If the new room gives your brain many competing details, the old intention has more competition.",
      "emphasis": "MORE COMPETITION",
      "pace": 0.98,
      "start_s": 108.8096,
      "speech_end_s": 115.4749,
      "end_s": 115.6249,
      "pause_after_s": 0.15,
      "audio_file": "sentence_audio/S26.wav"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "S27",
      "text": "If you were already distracted, the intention may have been weak before you crossed.",
      "emphasis": "WEAK BEFORE THE DOOR",
      "pace": 0.98,
      "start_s": 115.6249,
      "speech_end_s": 120.7216,
      "end_s": 120.8716,
      "pause_after_s": 0.15,
      "audio_file": "sentence_audio/S27.wav"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "S28",
      "text": "And if the intention was never strongly encoded, there may be very little to recover.",
      "emphasis": "NEVER STRONGLY HELD",
      "pace": 0.98,
      "start_s": 120.8716,
      "speech_end_s": 126.6735,
      "end_s": 126.8235,
      "pause_after_s": 0.15,
      "audio_file": "sentence_audio/S28.wav"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "S29",
      "text": "The famous doorway explanation is therefore only one piece of a larger memory system.",
      "emphasis": "ONE PIECE OF A SYSTEM",
      "pace": 0.98,
      "start_s": 126.8235,
      "speech_end_s": 133.0948,
      "end_s": 133.2448,
      "pause_after_s": 0.15,
      "audio_file": "sentence_audio/S29.wav"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "S30",
      "text": "Context changes can influence what is accessible, but the effect depends on the task and the person.",
      "emphasis": "CONTEXT DEPENDS",
      "pace": 0.98,
      "start_s": 133.2448,
      "speech_end_s": 140.2201,
      "end_s": 140.3701,
      "pause_after_s": 0.15,
      "audio_file": "sentence_audio/S30.wav"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "S31",
      "text": "A simple room is not a magical memory boundary.",
      "emphasis": "NOT MAGIC",
      "pace": 0.98,
      "start_s": 140.3701,
      "speech_end_s": 144.0615,
      "end_s": 144.2115,
      "pause_after_s": 0.15,
      "audio_file": "sentence_audio/S31.wav"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "S32",
      "text": "It is a change in the information your brain is using to organize the moment.",
      "emphasis": "INFORMATION UPDATED",
      "pace": 0.98,
      "start_s": 144.2115,
      "speech_end_s": 149.7688,
      "end_s": 149.9188,
      "pause_after_s": 0.15,
      "audio_file": "sentence_audio/S32.wav"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "S33",
      "text": "That shift can be tiny.",
      "emphasis": "A TINY SHIFT",
      "pace": 0.98,
      "start_s": 149.9188,
      "speech_end_s": 151.9661,
      "end_s": 152.1161,
      "pause_after_s": 0.15,
      "audio_file": "sentence_audio/S33.wav"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "S34",
      "text": "Yet a tiny shift can be enough to interrupt a fragile goal.",
      "emphasis": "FRAGILE GOAL",
      "pace": 0.98,
      "start_s": 152.1161,
      "speech_end_s": 156.4034,
      "end_s": 156.5534,
      "pause_after_s": 0.15,
      "audio_file": "sentence_audio/S34.wav"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "S35",
      "text": "This is why retracing your steps sometimes works.",
      "emphasis": "RETRACE THE PATH",
      "pace": 0.98,
      "start_s": 156.5534,
      "speech_end_s": 160.2647,
      "end_s": 160.4147,
      "pause_after_s": 0.15,
      "audio_file": "sentence_audio/S35.wav"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "S36",
      "text": "The old context brings back some of the cues that surrounded the intention.",
      "emphasis": "THE OLD CUES RETURN",
      "pace": 0.98,
      "start_s": 160.4147,
      "speech_end_s": 165.7373,
      "end_s": 165.8873,
      "pause_after_s": 0.15,
      "audio_file": "sentence_audio/S36.wav"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "S37",
      "text": "The keys are visible again.",
      "emphasis": "SEE THE KEYS",
      "pace": 0.98,
      "start_s": 165.8873,
      "speech_end_s": 168.276,
      "end_s": 168.426,
      "pause_after_s": 0.15,
      "audio_file": "sentence_audio/S37.wav"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "S38",
      "text": "The half-finished sentence is back in your mind.",
      "emphasis": "THE SENTENCE RETURNS",
      "pace": 0.98,
      "start_s": 168.426,
      "speech_end_s": 171.8386,
      "end_s": 171.9886,
      "pause_after_s": 0.15,
      "audio_file": "sentence_audio/S38.wav"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "S39",
      "text": "The brain did not necessarily recover a deleted file.",
      "emphasis": "NOT FILE RECOVERY",
      "pace": 0.98,
      "start_s": 171.9886,
      "speech_end_s": 176.2433,
      "end_s": 176.3933,
      "pause_after_s": 0.15,
      "audio_file": "sentence_audio/S39.wav"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "S40",
      "text": "It reconstructed the route to the goal using familiar cues.",
      "emphasis": "REBUILD THE ROUTE",
      "pace": 0.98,
      "start_s": 176.3933,
      "speech_end_s": 180.7119,
      "end_s": 180.8619,
      "pause_after_s": 0.15,
      "audio_file": "sentence_audio/S40.wav"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "S41",
      "text": "That also explains why speaking an intention can help.",
      "emphasis": "SAY THE GOAL",
      "pace": 0.98,
      "start_s": 180.8619,
      "speech_end_s": 184.8833,
      "end_s": 185.0333,
      "pause_after_s": 0.15,
      "audio_file": "sentence_audio/S41.wav"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "S42",
      "text": "Words create another cue that can survive a context change.",
      "emphasis": "ANOTHER ANCHOR",
      "pace": 0.98,
      "start_s": 185.0333,
      "speech_end_s": 189.4699,
      "end_s": 189.6199,
      "pause_after_s": 0.15,
      "audio_file": "sentence_audio/S42.wav"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "S43",
      "text": "Writing it down creates an external cue instead of asking working memory to carry everything.",
      "emphasis": "EXTERNAL CUE",
      "pace": 0.98,
      "start_s": 189.6199,
      "speech_end_s": 196.2639,
      "end_s": 196.4139,
      "pause_after_s": 0.15,
      "audio_file": "sentence_audio/S43.wav"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "S44",
      "text": "None of these guarantees perfect memory.",
      "emphasis": "NO GUARANTEES",
      "pace": 0.98,
      "start_s": 196.4139,
      "speech_end_s": 199.3785,
      "end_s": 199.5285,
      "pause_after_s": 0.15,
      "audio_file": "sentence_audio/S44.wav"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "S45",
      "text": "They simply give the goal more routes back into attention.",
      "emphasis": "MORE ROUTES BACK",
      "pace": 0.98,
      "start_s": 199.5285,
      "speech_end_s": 203.3465,
      "end_s": 203.4965,
      "pause_after_s": 0.15,
      "audio_file": "sentence_audio/S45.wav"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "S46",
      "text": "So when you forget why you entered a room, do not immediately call yourself careless.",
      "emphasis": "NOT CARELESS",
      "pace": 0.98,
      "start_s": 203.4965,
      "speech_end_s": 208.8931,
      "end_s": 209.0431,
      "pause_after_s": 0.15,
      "audio_file": "sentence_audio/S46.wav"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "S47",
      "text": "Ask what changed, what competed for attention and which cue could restore the goal.",
      "emphasis": "ASK WHAT CHANGED?",
      "pace": 0.98,
      "start_s": 209.0431,
      "speech_end_s": 214.7058,
      "end_s": 214.8558,
      "pause_after_s": 0.15,
      "audio_file": "sentence_audio/S47.wav"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "S48",
      "text": "The doorway may have exposed a small weakness in the way the intention was being held.",
      "emphasis": "A WEAK LINK",
      "pace": 0.98,
      "start_s": 214.8558,
      "speech_end_s": 220.5198,
      "end_s": 220.6698,
      "pause_after_s": 0.15,
      "audio_file": "sentence_audio/S48.wav"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "S49",
      "text": "That weakness is a mechanism, not a verdict about your intelligence.",
      "emphasis": "NOT A VERDICT",
      "pace": 0.92,
      "start_s": 220.6698,
      "speech_end_s": 225.8218,
      "end_s": 225.9718,
      "pause_after_s": 0.15,
      "audio_file": "sentence_audio/S49.wav"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "S50",
      "text": "And sometimes the quickest way forward is simply to step back, find the cue and let the machine rebuild the route.",
      "emphasis": "FIND THE CUE",
      "pace": 0.92,
      "start_s": 225.9718,
      "speech_end_s": 233.9184,
      "end_s": 234.1584,
      "pause_after_s": 0.24,
      "audio_file": "sentence_audio/S50.wav"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "S51",
      "text": "What were you trying to do the last time a doorway made you forget?",
      "emphasis": "WHAT DID YOU FORGET?",
      "pace": 0.98,
      "start_s": 234.1584,
      "speech_end_s": 238.1144,
      "end_s": 238.2644,
      "pause_after_s": 0.15,
      "audio_file": "sentence_audio/S51.wav"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "S52",
      "text": "What cue could help you find your way back next time?",
      "emphasis": "FIND YOUR WAY BACK",
      "pace": 0.94,
      "start_s": 238.2644,
      "speech_end_s": 241.4838,
      "end_s": 241.7638,
      "pause_after_s": 0.28,
      "audio_file": "sentence_audio/S52.wav"
    }
  ]
}